        "text": "<thinking> To complete the task, I need to create the specified Python files with the required functionalities and integrations. The scored implementation files must use a concrete external provider and make that provider identifiable in the code. The local helper files can contain configuration loading, payload normalization, or response parsing utilities. I will start by creating the initial file `extract_invoice_fields.py` using Google Cloud Vision API for document extraction. </thinking>\n",
